# Hash manifest for the derived modeling artifacts.
#
# The files themselves are gitignored (~13MB of parquet/npy, all regenerable
# from data/raw + scripts/). This manifest is what git tracks, so a rebuild can
# be checked byte-for-byte -- the same role frozen_manifest.json plays for
# data/graph_global. Verify with:  sha256sum -c MANIFEST.sha256
#
# CAVEAT, recorded 2026-09-07: these hashes are NOT from a single pipeline run.
# draft_model_table.parquet was rewritten at 15:43; every other file dates from
# 14:57-14:58. Treat the set as provisional until one clean end-to-end run
# regenerates it.
#
# SUPERSEDED: identity_matrix_dense.npy, identity_matrix_sparse.csv and
# player_index.csv are the 43160x6 rank-bucket artifacts that docs/Model_Building.md
# identifies as NOT the deck identity representation. Hashed here to preserve the
# dead end (INSTRUCTIONS.md section 6), not because they are usable inputs.
